    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bakso Simulator is back!</strong> Get ready to rebuild your Bakso Empire with new gameplay mechanics! Encounter both familiar and new faces, explore larger areas, and more! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the footsteps of the legendary bakso seller, Rabas, as he ventures back to his peaceful hometown in the Indonesian countryside. Inheriting a substantial fortune from his late father, Rabas embarks on a new chapter, filled with both challenges and opportunities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features :</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover new areas set in a beautiful Indonesian village</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A much improved decorating system where players are more free on where to place objects!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your bakso cart cooler and more efficient by customizing and upgrading it!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your shop and buy supplies by utilizing your new laptop and smartphone!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire staffs to help you sell bakso and keep customers happy!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use various tools to keep your shop safe and clean!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A brand new house for Rabas to relax and plan his day!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bakso Simulator is back!</strong> Get ready to rebuild your Bakso Empire with new gameplay mechanics! Encounter both familiar and new faces, explore larger areas, and more! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the footsteps of the legendary bakso seller, Rabas, as he ventures back to his peaceful hometown in the Indonesian countryside. Inheriting a substantial fortune from his late father, Rabas embarks on a new chapter, filled with both challenges and opportunities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features :</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover new areas set in a beautiful Indonesian village</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A much improved decorating system where players are more free on where to place objects!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your bakso cart cooler and more efficient by customizing and upgrading it!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your shop and buy supplies by utilizing your new laptop and smartphone!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire staffs to help you sell bakso and keep customers happy!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use various tools to keep your shop safe and clean!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A brand new house for Rabas to relax and plan his day!</p></li></ul>",
